<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs weak/off $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs weak/off $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts weak to $0.50 lower. Demand was moderate. Top $51.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-2 230-260 lbs. 50.00-50.50, few  49.50 and 51.00.</p>
<p>Sows - mostly steady. Top $50.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-3   300-400 lbs. 40.00-43.00</p>
<p>		 400-500 lbs. 43.00-45.00</p>
<p>		 500-600 lbs. 45.00-48.00 few 49.00.</p>
<p>		 few over    600 lbs. 47.00-50.00</p>
</text>
